    <value>FAQ</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Question1.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How to back up my data?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Question5.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How to report a bug or suggest a feature?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Question4.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How to get admin privileges?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Question3.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Forgot account password?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Question2.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How to sync data across multiple PCs?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Answer1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Copy the entire "AzurLaneDex" folder from the user data location above to a safe place. To restore, overwrite the original location.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Answer5.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to submit an issue on the project homepage.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Answer4.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Go to Account → Your Accounts → Request Admin, enter the system admin password (default password for 'developer'), and your current account will be promoted to admin, unlocking ship add/edit features.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Answer3.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>If you set a security question, click "Forgot password?" on the login screen to reset via the security answer. Otherwise, contact the developer or create a new account (data will be lost).</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpPage_Answer2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Cloud sync is not supported. You can manually back up the data folder and copy it to the same location on the new PC after installing the app.</value>
  </data>
